1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:01,280
Imagine biting this

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:02,480
juicy lemon.

3
00:00:02,480 --> 00:00:03,544
Your mouth's watering,

4
00:00:03,544 --> 00:00:04,230
right?

5
00:00:04,230 --> 00:00:05,430
There's no lemon...

6
00:00:05,430 --> 00:00:06,525
your brain just took

7
00:00:06,525 --> 00:00:08,033
a PRACTICE bite.

8
00:00:08,070 --> 00:00:08,996
Feel that flood

9
00:00:08,996 --> 00:00:10,316
under your tongue?

10
00:00:10,316 --> 00:00:11,940
Now imagine licking it.

11
00:00:11,940 --> 00:00:13,333
Slowly.

12
00:00:13,370 --> 00:00:15,251
Lemon means acid...

13
00:00:15,251 --> 00:00:16,319
so your brain hoses

14
00:00:16,319 --> 00:00:18,033
your teeth down early.

15
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:19,050
In one lab,

16
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:20,060
people drooled

17
00:00:20,060 --> 00:00:21,375
just WATCHING

18
00:00:21,375 --> 00:00:23,000
a man eat a lemon.

19
00:00:23,050 --> 00:00:24,577
The more they drooled...

20
00:00:24,577 --> 00:00:25,485
the more they cared

21
00:00:25,485 --> 00:00:27,023
about others.

22
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:28,100
Drooling?

23
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:30,080
Congrats, you're nice.

24
00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:31,270
Not drooling?

25
00:00:31,270 --> 00:00:32,667
Watch him again.

